1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,267
The canteen serves soup at the same
minute every day. One bowl. One slice
of bread. One cup of water.

2
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:12,200
Rule five. Water is counted, not
owned. Everybody gets one cup. Nobody
gets two.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:18,167
At the next table, a little boy drops
his cup. It spills across the floor.
Every eye turns.

4
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:23,133
His face goes gray. He just lost his
day of water. He's maybe seven.

5
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:27,433
You have a full cup. He has none. The
rule says nobody gets two.

6
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:31,033
Would you pour half into his cup? Or
follow the rule?

7
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:37,400
I poured half. Rule five says nobody
gets two cups. It says nothing about
sharing one.

8
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,400
A woman at the next table nods. Nobody
reports you. Not yet.
